  "description": "Dew.Math.Tee adds high-performance WinForms charting to Dew.Math by bundling the free TeeChart Lite\nassembly directly in this package (no external NuGet dependency). It enables fast visualization of\nvectors, matrices, and signal/statistical data on .NET Framework 4.8.\n\nIncluded visualization enhancements:\n- MtxFastLine: fast line plotting optimized for millions of points\n- MtxGridSeries: accelerated heatmap/matrix rendering with palette management\n- High-throughput helpers for streaming data into TeeChart series\n- Optional use with Dew.Signal and Dew.Stats components\n\nPlatform model:\n- .NET Framework 4.8 (WinForms) only\n- TeeChart Lite DLL is included inside this package\n- No WPF, and no .NET (Core/5+/8/9) support in this package\n\nUse Dew.Math.Tee when building WinForms desktop tools that require fast plotting and visualization\non top of Dew.Math.",
